{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Golden Curse","Taoist Cui accidentally released the treasure-gathering golden toad in order to read the heavenly book. The golden toad coveted the prosperity of the human world and reincarnated as a human, Dou Zhanlong. In order to avoid the heavenly calamity, the golden toad tore the three souls and seven spirits in Dou Zhanlong's spiritual cavity, creating nine clones, which fell into nine places respectively. The nine Dou Zhanlongs were in different parallel time and space, and each death gave rise to a new clone. They experienced \"nine deaths and thirteen disasters\" in total. Our story starts with the first Dou Zhanlong.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, translated)"],"ja":["财神窦占龙",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-61649","ids":{"shikimori":61649,"mal":61649,"anilist":215522,"kodik":"serial-77670"},"kodikIds":["serial-77666","serial-77667","serial-77670","serial-77695"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-77666":"2026-10-25T10:18:03Z","serial-77667":"2026-10-19T06:42:51Z","serial-77670":"2026-10-26T06:44:07Z","serial-77695":"2026-09-03T17:21:07Z"},"title":"Бог богатства Чжаньлун Доу","originalTitle":"Caishen Dou Zhanlong","alt":"Бог богатства Доу Чжаньлун / История бога богатства / Golden Curse Golden Curse 财神窦占龙","description":"Taoist Cui accidentally released the treasure-gathering golden toad in order to read the heavenly book. The golden toad coveted the prosperity of the human world and reincarnated as a human, Dou Zhanlong. In order to avoid the heavenly calamity, the golden toad tore the three souls and seven spirits in Dou Zhanlong's spiritual cavity, creating nine clones, which fell into nine places respectively. The nine Dou Zhanlongs were in different parallel time and space, and each death gave rise to a new clone. They experienced \"nine deaths and thirteen disasters\" in total. Our story starts with the first Dou Zhanlong. (Source: iQIYI, translated)","year":2026,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","